<h1>Animalica: Toolsmith</h1>
<p>i took a tool head, an animal fitting and somebody else’s binding. the result is a tool a fox can actually wear.</p>
<h2>what the fox put together</h2>
<p>an optional Body Tools addon with 60 fitting combinations. choose exactly one provider: Toolsmith 1.2.19+ or LTO BlackSmith Plus 3.0.1+, with that provider’s dependencies. native assembly, wear, sharpening and surviving-part recovery stay with the chosen provider. switching providers does not convert saved modular items.</p>
<h2>bring these along</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>game</strong>: 1.22.0 or later</li>
<li><strong>animalicabodytools</strong>: 1.6.20 or later</li>
<li><strong>playermodellib</strong>: 1.23.8 or later</li>
<li><strong>traitrestrictions</strong>: 1.0.0 or later</li>
</ul>
<h2>the check sheet</h2>
<p>the release record keeps the exact version, package hash and test limits. source compilation is a separate check; it does not establish new gameplay acceptance.</p>
<p><em>mod was made with AI assistance. Pls no hate.</em></p>
